{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready for a story where you\u2019ll discover the flavors of traditional cuisine!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the streets of Istanbul, you inherit a small restaurant from your grandfather. Rediscover traditional recipes and struggle to survive in the shadow of modern fast-food chains. You won\u2019t just be cooking meals\u2014you\u2019ll meet the city\u2019s vibrant characters, share in their stories, and make the right choices to grow your restaurant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traditional Recipes</strong>: Prepare authentic dishes and satisfy your customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Living City</strong>: Experience the cultural spirit of Istanbul and interact with diverse NPC characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight Against Fast Food</strong>: Compete with the fast-food industry and keep your restaurant alive. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Driven Simulation</strong>: Uncover a heartfelt story while managing your culinary journey. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travel Opportunities</strong>: Visit different countries and cities to learn new recipes and expand your menu.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4019230?t=1767632303","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4019230?t=1767632303","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019230/72c8644041da92083258965454ddf2e01621f88e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767632303","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019230/72c8644041da92083258965454ddf2e01621f88e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767632303","categories":[{"description":"Singl